      <chord name="Bb"/>There&#x27;s the wonder of <chord name="F7"/>sunset at <chord name="Bb"/>evening, <chord name="Bb7"/>The <chord name="Eb"/>wonder as sunrise I <chord name="Bb"/>see;<br/>
