      <chord name="F"/>O, the <chord name="Bb"/>wonder <chord name="F7"/>of it <chord name="Bb"/>all! <chord name="Bb7"/>The <chord name="Eb"/>wonder of it all! <chord name="A7"/>Just to <chord name="Bb"/>think that <chord name="F7"/>God loves <chord name="Bb"/>me.<br/>
